    "text": "According to the&nbsp;ideal gas equation:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PV</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>nRT</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>xR</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
